{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2022-02-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION CFO JENNIFER HAMANN TO ADDRESS THE STIFEL 2022 TRANSPORTATION AND LOGISTICS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB., FEB. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JENNIFER HAMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, OF UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: UNP) WILL ADDRESS THE STIFEL 2022 TRANSPORTATION AND LOGISTICS CONFERENCE AT 10:40 A.M.'}